{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Crystant</strong></i> is a post-apocalyptic survival game where you play as a test subject trapped in an underground laboratory. Step by step, you explore the corridors ahead, facing mysterious creatures and unknown events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/b57c3f078f0a4899094ff3382da57210.webp?t=1771053769\" width=1500 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up from a sudden quake, reminded of your current predicament\u2014locked away in a windowless laboratory. <br>Suddenly, the door opens. Blinding white light floods in, revealing a long corridor leading into the unknown. Flickering lights shimmer in the distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long hesitation, you finally muster the courage to venture forward\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/b57c3f078f0a4899094ff3382da57210.webp?t=1771053769\" width=1500 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounters filled with unknown dangers</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/b842161c02d27ac903a2fb3a62579ce9.poster.avif?t=1771053769\" width=864 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/b842161c02d27ac903a2fb3a62579ce9.webm?t=1771053769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/b842161c02d27ac903a2fb3a62579ce9.mp4?t=1771053769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip specialized weapons to enhance your class abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different classes can equip their corresponding signature weapons, allowing each character to unleash their full potential.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/426f1c85379a374cee5d18ba49f9876e.avif?t=1771053769\" width=1560 height=483 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge for resources and struggle to survive</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources are scarce and filled with danger. Every expedition may lead to a breakthrough\u2014or a disaster. You must make critical decisions with limited supplies to ensure you survive long enough to reach the next floor.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique tactical, turn-based combat system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is built on a predictable yet deeply strategic grid-based system. Players must carefully consider positioning, skill timing, and enemy behavior patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies with randomized attribute enhancements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During every run, enemies may gain random enhancement traits, turning familiar foes into unpredictable threats and forcing you to adapt your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/365954dd30aadcb720379953c325f5e8.avif?t=1771053769\" width=1560 height=483 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stronger Enemies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the deeper areas, you\u2019ll encounter more powerful foes \u2014 enemies with higher defenses, deadlier attack patterns, and unique abilities. Stay cautious and use your resources and strategies wisely if you hope to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/1ce03abd4c99ebd61203643550ad2dd2.avif?t=1771053769\" width=1560 height=483 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Combat Build</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the four core attributes, enhance your team\u2019s capabilities, and build the strategy that suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect special chips to accelerate progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learning Chips can be used to enhance core attributes and accelerate your character\u2019s growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/2c4989f7a870fc2302517b3917cb4d62.avif?t=1771053769\" width=1560 height=483 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Access recovery, training, and insight functions in specific areas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In designated rest areas, you can use <strong>Recovery</strong> to regain HP through short rest, <strong>Training</strong> to consume Chips for ability upgrades and faster EXP gain, and <strong>Insight</strong> to operate surveillance systems that remotely reveal sections of the map. These features provide breathing room between encounters and allow you to plan ahead for the increasingly dangerous zones ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/4e623abc917a73c26de4c46758f559ac.avif?t=1771053769\" width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Out-of-run upgrades unlock new classes and enhance abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By earning special points during gameplay, players can unlock additional character classes and passive upgrades, encouraging them to continuously experiment with different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carry over EXP and CV into a new run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each cycle, accumulated experience and special currency are carried over, giving you an advantage in the next run and reinforcing the long-term progression of a roguelite structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect story fragments to uncover the truth behind the disaster</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered research logs and fragmented documents can be found throughout the facility. Piecing them together gradually reveals the laboratory\u2019s secrets and the true cause of the disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/c3a48d7bf64f03081e825ebabd935371.poster.avif?t=1771053769\" width=864 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/c3a48d7bf64f03081e825ebabd935371.webm?t=1771053769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/c3a48d7bf64f03081e825ebabd935371.mp4?t=1771053769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3006090?t=1771053769","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/e95b6c33bd50e4804467c8d88db0cf9679856046/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771053769","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/fc68ab40ca325f2669a64381cc97180958276d4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771053769","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/fc68ab40ca325f2669a64381cc97180958276d4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771053769","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contain content not suitable for all ages or for viewing in the workplace: general adult themes."},"demos":[{"appid":3971850,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Crystant</strong></i> is a post-apocalyptic survival game where you play as a test subject trapped in an underground laboratory. Step by step, you explore the corridors ahead, facing mysterious creatures and unknown events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/b57c3f078f0a4899094ff3382da57210.webp?t=1771053769\" width=1500 height=45 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up from a sudden quake, reminded of your current predicament\u2014locked away in a windowless laboratory. <br>Suddenly, the door opens. Blinding white light floods in, revealing a long corridor leading into the unknown. Flickering lights shimmer in the distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a long hesitation, you finally muster the courage to venture forward\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"