ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/2c4989f7a870fc2302517b3917cb4d62.avif?t=1771053769\" width=1560 height=483 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Access recovery, training, and insight functions in specific areas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In designated rest areas, you can use <strong>Recovery</strong> to regain HP through short rest, <strong>Training</strong> to consume Chips for ability upgrades and faster EXP gain, and <strong>Insight</strong> to operate surveillance systems that remotely reveal sections of the map. These features provide breathing room between encounters and allow you to plan ahead for the increasingly dangerous zones ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/4e623abc917a73c26de4c46758f559ac.avif?t=1771053769\" width=1560 height=879 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Out-of-run upgrades unlock new classes and enhance abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By earning special points during gameplay, players can unlock additional character classes and passive upgrades, encouraging them to continuously experiment with different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carry over EXP and CV into a new run</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each cycle, accumulated experience and special currency are carried over, giving you an advantage in the next run and reinforcing the long-term progression of a roguelite structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect story fragments to uncover the truth behind the disaster</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scattered research logs and fragmented documents can be found throughout the facility. Piecing them together gradually reveals the laboratory\u2019s secrets and the true cause of the disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/c3a48d7bf64f03081e825ebabd935371.poster.avif?t=1771053769\" width=864 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/c3a48d7bf64f03081e825ebabd935371.webm?t=1771053769\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/extras/c3a48d7bf64f03081e825ebabd935371.mp4?t=1771053769\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["DAWNER"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3006090/3b0910806b07612423880ff7e60c7091e7ca1f57/header.jpg?t=1771053769","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3006090/841923128/370134ba58166d473660af94fb74e1b5c2651e53/1765414581/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771053769","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3006090/841923128/370134ba58166d473660af94fb74e1b5c2651e53/1765414581/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771053769","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3006090/841923128/370134ba58166d473660af94fb74e1b5c2651e53/1765414581/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771053769","id":257246997,"name":"Crystant Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257246997/8b13dde8d2125101296f7d65eb6ec172bc347f30/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771053769"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3006090/1741857589/85cefea9e9d51d676aa1fafeba95460cb51406